{"body":{"text":["Glue met as the chassis was broken away was let go (20/21, 20/22). The chassis's own test draws with components of its own. The tokens, a drawing's host and a note are the chassis's look, in `chassis/web/look/`, every component drawing with its tokens. A link is made in one place, `chassis/web/href.ts`, as the page keeps its address, and no component reads the address: an answer says what was asked by its steps, as the pills say them, and a list keeps how it was shown by what it holds. The breadcrumb is one read of `wholes` and the start one of `roots`, functions written in the language upon the natives. The components hand the chassis what it needs in one call, the chassis finding by type among them itself, and the chassis gives a component no answer the same as the last, so no component checks. A component picked for a use is written strictly, from the heads its use was read at. Left for the author to weigh: what a card says written in the language as one function; whether asking, the bar shown or not, is state in the field rather than the page's; a card a component of its own; keeping what was shown until the next shows, done four ways; and the holon as the native holon gives it, decoded in five places. *The session's, at the author's word (20/21); built.*"]},"id":"1M83T7EW5CM6000","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}
{"body":{"text":["Natives are small pure functions in code, in families: the lazy ones, `if`, `case`, `and`, `or`; values; lists; sets, which are hashed; holons, `holon`, `whole`, `in`, `out`, `follow`; history, `log`; and patterns; and the pairs glass ships, `parse` and `print`, `steps` and `chain`, with `each`, `group` and the way back, `back`. Beside them stand legacy natives, `type`, `store`, `named`, `children` and `since` among them, kept only while functions written in the field still call them. Everything else is written in the field upon the natives, as `sections`, which the brief component reads by, and `wholes` and `roots` are (20/16, 20/22)."]},"id":"1M83T7EW5CM6001","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000002"]}